{"series":{"id":"voting-administration::eac-turnout-of-all-registered","label":"Reported counted-ballot voters as % of total registrations reported","dataset_id":"frozen-atlas","unit":"percent of total registrations reported","scope":"us_states","definition":"Calculated 100 × state sum(F1a) / state sum(A1a). Numerator and denominator are reported administrative fields, with jurisdiction coverage exceptions preserved.","denominator":"EAVS A1a: all registrations reported, including active/inactive as reported by states","reporting_period":"November 5, 2024 general election","source_url":"https://www.eac.gov/sites/default/files/2026-02/2024_EAVS_for_Public_Release_nolabel_V2_csv.zip","sources":[{"id":"eac-2024-v2","title":"U.S. EAC · 2024 Election Administration and Voting Survey, Version 2","url":"https://www.eac.gov/sites/default/files/2026-02/2024_EAVS_for_Public_Release_nolabel_V2_csv.zip","date":"2026-02-12 release; November 5, 2024 election","note":"Administrative jurisdiction submissions; state totals here sum valid nonnegative reports, matching the report’s aggregation. Negative missing/skip codes are excluded, never converted to measured zero. Coverage exceptions are preserved.","license":"U.S. federal government public information; source attribution retained."},{"id":"eac-2024-report","title":"U.S. EAC · 2024 EAVS report and calculation notes","url":"https://www.eac.gov/sites/default/files/2025-07/2024_EAVS_Report_508.pdf","date":"2025-07 report; read with February 2026 errata","note":"Executive Summary Table 1 identifies A1b active registrations and F1a voters casting a counted ballot. F1a/A1b is turnout as a percent of active registration; it is not presidential candidate votes.","license":"U.S. federal government public information; source attribution retained."}],"limitations":["Administrative EAVS submissions are distinct from CPS self-reports and presidential candidate vote totals. They must not share an unlabeled denominator.","North Dakota has no voter-registration requirement; administrative registration counts and registered-denominator percentages are not applicable and remain null.","Total registrations (A1a) and active registrations (A1b) are different denominators. State registration practices and inactive-status rules vary; neither denominator is the voting-eligible population.","State totals sum valid nonnegative jurisdiction reports. Missing/skip entries are excluded, not measured zeros. Local nonresponse/skip codes occur in Arkansas (F1a), Hawaii (A1a/A1b/F1a), Illinois (A1b), Maine (A1a/A1b/F1a), Ohio (A1b), and Utah (F1a); CSV preserves exact counts and source comments. Some Maine units are explicitly included in other jurisdictions, so a code is not automatically missing population coverage.","F1a counts voters casting a ballot that was counted; it is not total presidential votes and does not include every rejected ballot. Ratios have no sampling interval."],"interval_type":null,"display_reference":null,"years":[2024],"places":[{"id":"AL","name":"Alabama"},{"id":"AK","name":"Alaska"},{"id":"AZ","name":"Arizona"},{"id":"AR","name":"Arkansas"},{"id":"CA","name":"California"},{"id":"CO","name":"Colorado"},{"id":"CT","name":"Connecticut"},{"id":"DE","name":"Delaware"},{"id":"DC","name":"District of Columbia"},{"id":"FL","name":"Florida"},{"id":"GA","name":"Georgia"},{"id":"HI","name":"Hawaii"},{"id":"ID","name":"Idaho"},{"id":"IL","name":"Illinois"},{"id":"IN","name":"Indiana"},{"id":"IA","name":"Iowa"},{"id":"KS","name":"Kansas"},{"id":"KY","name":"Kentucky"},{"id":"LA","name":"Louisiana"},{"id":"ME","name":"Maine"},{"id":"MD","name":"Maryland"},{"id":"MA","name":"Massachusetts"},{"id":"MI","name":"Michigan"},{"id":"MN","name":"Minnesota"},{"id":"MS","name":"Mississippi"},{"id":"MO","name":"Missouri"},{"id":"MT","name":"Montana"},{"id":"NE","name":"Nebraska"},{"id":"NV","name":"Nevada"},{"id":"NH","name":"New Hampshire"},{"id":"NJ","name":"New Jersey"},{"id":"NM","name":"New Mexico"},{"id":"NY","name"